<title>USA: Dow Jones average gains more than 100 points.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones average gains more than 100 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average gained more than 100 points in late afternoon trading Monday as the market extended its run into record territory.</p>
<p>At 3:30 a.m. EDT, the Dow was up 101.14 points at 7,172.34, eclipsing its March 11 record close of 7,085.36.</p>
